{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessment concerns one SFC-authorised fund offered to the public in Hong Kong; listed closed-ended alternative asset funds are excluded from this circular's scope.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV are measured at the same assessment time in a common exact valuation unit. Integer inputs require an exact common scale, without rounding at the 50% boundary.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The supplied exposure amounts use an established measurement and aggregation method that avoids unintended double counting. The retained text does not establish that method.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"An SFC designation means an actual designation applicable to this Fund at the assessment time; risk factors or enhanced scrutiny alone do not establish designation.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result addresses classification under this circular, not overall distribution compliance or classification under other instruments.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"4667f572c143e614eef24dd953a702adb0d536f7a43c7854b0e90fe4cd0f0dc7","candidate_id":"candidate.893a98923f8b441180d3669682a8c63a","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an in-scope Fund with positive NAV, does either classification route under this circular require treating the Fund as a complex product for distribution at the assessment time? True means total direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV, or an applicable SFC designation exists. False means exposure is below 50% and no applicable designation exists; it does not establish non-complex status under other rules or prevent future designation. Missing facts remain unknown, and an out-of-scope fund receives no classification answer. This is a classification predicate, not legal approval or a compliance finding.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.0aecefa466af43978ceebf44cfcdea1b","issue.1b56283907ab42efa5b87f3d5b534c15","issue.ce78297d9dd8493b93985283692ecab4","issue.107bbd02504b465597637d2ae77e54f6","issue.6d974e416d1444839dae6d8d16fa46fd"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"The model separates the Fund from its underlying assets and intermediate instruments, adds direct and indirect exposure, and distinguishes an automatic threshold from an actual discretionary SFC decision. Neither below-threshold exposure nor missing designation evidence establishes non-complex status. LAF exclusion is a scope exclusion, not a finding that the fund is non-complex. The separate 15% direct-investment limit is not this classification threshold.","run_id":"run.c9f901e6cb5d4c1a9f2485b7016bb3b5","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"be86c12a28ac1c552b9cc386dfa44174629a63a786068d9bf5d8cdb44cbfa056","source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u32.4805","d4148dd852cee.u4.564","d4148dd852cee.u49.6955","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979","d4148dd852cee.u63.8691","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Complex-product classification of an individual Fund for distribution"}